Subject: [PATCH 5/8] One line for the sibling pairs, and a phone that opens on
 pupils

56 pairs drawn as rows put three screens of review work between the
figures and the roll, and no test could see it because the fixture holds
one pair. Now one line, expanding on request.

Deleting them outright was asked for and refused: portal/families/ does
not exist and md-families is still soon, so removal would leave 56
findings in the database with nothing showing them - and families drive
sibling discounts, so wrong families are wrong money.

On a phone the figure tiles become one swipeable row, about 100px instead
of 600, so the first screen contains a child rather than furniture.

